#. Tag: title
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Opis"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdesu; is a graphical front end for the &UNIX; <command>su</command> "
"command for the K Desktop Environment. It allows you to run a program as "
"different user by supplying the password for that user. &kdesu; is an "
"unprivileged program; it uses the system's <command>su</command>."
msgstr ""
"&kdesu; je prednji grafički završetak za &UNIX; <command>su</command> "
"naredba za K Desktop Okruženje. Dozvoljava vam da pokrenrtr program kao "
"drugi korisnik unoseći odgovarajuću lozinku. &kdesu; je jedan neprivilegovan "
"program; koristi sistemsku naredbu <command>su</command>."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kdesu; has one additional feature: it can optionally remember passwords for "
"you. If you are using this feature, you only need to enter the password once "
"for each command."
msgstr ""
"&kdesu; ima jedno dodatno svojstvo: postoji mogućnost da zapamti vašu "
"lozinku. Ukoliko upotrebljavate ovo svojstvo, potrebno je da samo jednom "
"unesete lozinku za svaku naredbu."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This program is meant to be started from the command line or from <filename>."
"desktop</filename> files."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj program bi trebao biti pokrenut sa komandne linije ili iz <filename>."
"desktop</filename> datoteke."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since <command>kdesu</command> is no longer installed in <userinput> $(kde4-"
"config --prefix)</userinput>/bin but in <userinput>kde4-config --path "
"libexec</userinput> and therefore not in your <envar>Path</envar>, you have "
"to use <userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</command></"
"userinput> to launch <command>kdesu</command>."
msgstr ""
"Budući da <command>kdesu</command> naredba više nije instalirana u "
"<userinput> $(kde4-config --prefix)</userinput>/bin nego u <userinput>kde4-"
"config --path libexec</userinput> pa samim tim ni u <envar>Path</envar>, "
"morate koristiti <userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</"
"command></userinput> za pokretanje <command>kdesu</command>."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcije"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "-c <replaceable>command</replaceable>"
msgstr "-c <replaceable>naredba</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:80
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This specifies the command to run as root. It has to be passed in one "
"argument. So if, for example, you want to start a new file manager, you "
"would enter at the prompt: <userinput>$(kde4-config --path "
"libexec)<command>kdesu <option>-c <replaceable> &dolphin;</replaceable></"
"option></command></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Ovo određuje da se naredba pokrene kao korijen. Mora biti proslijeđena "
"jednim argumentom. Pa ukoliko, naprimjer, želite pokrenuti novi fajl "
"menadžer, unijeli biste: <userinput>$(kde4-config --path "
"libexec)<command>kdesu <option>-c <replaceable> &dolphin;</replaceable></"
"option></command></userinput>"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-d</option>"
msgstr "<option>-d</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show debug information."
msgstr "Prikaži debug informacije."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "-f <replaceable>file</replaceable>"
msgstr "-f <replaceable>datoteka</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This option allow efficient use of &kdesu; in <filename>.desktop</filename> "
"files. It tells &kdesu; to examine the file specified by <parameter>file</"
"parameter>. If this file is writable by the current user, &kdesu; will "
"execute the command as the current user. If it is not writable, the command "
"is executed as user <parameter>user</parameter> (defaults to root)."
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija omogućava efikasnu upotrebu &kdesu; u <filename>.desktop</"
"filename> datotekama. Govori &kdesu; da pregleda datoteku određenu pomoću "
"<parameter>file</parameter>. Ako je trenutnom korisniku omogućeno pisanje u "
"ovu datoteku, &kdesu; će izvršiti naredbu kao trenutni korisnik. Ukoliko "
"pisanje nije omogućeno, naredba će biti izvršena od strane korisnika "
"<parameter>user</parameter> (zadano u korijenu)."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<parameter>file</parameter> is evaluated like this: if <parameter>file</"
"parameter> starts with a <literal>/</literal>, it is taken as an absolute "
"filename. Otherwise, it is taken as the name of a global &kde; configuration "
"file."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>file</parameter> se procjenjuje ovako: ako <parameter>file</"
"parameter> počinje sa <literal>/</literal>, to se uzima kao potpuni naziv "
"datoteke. U protivnom, uzima se kao ime globalne &kde; konfiguracijske "
"datoteke."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-i</option> <replaceable>icon name</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>-i</option> <replaceable>ime ikonice</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Specify icon to use in the password dialog. You may specify just the name, "
"without any extension."
msgstr ""
"Navedite ikonicu za dijalog za unos lozinke. Možete navesti samo ime, bez "
"ikakvih nastavaka."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-n</option>"
msgstr "<option>-n</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do not keep the password. This disables the <guilabel>keep password</"
"guilabel> checkbox in the password dialog."
msgstr ""
"Ne zadržavati lozinku. Ovo onemogućava <guilabel>zadržati lozinku</guilabel> "
"checkbox uz lozinku."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:115
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-p</option> <replaceable>priority</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>-p</option> <replaceable>prioritet</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Set priority value. The priority is an arbitrary number between 0 and 100, "
"where 100 means highest priority, and 0 means lowest. The default is 50."
msgstr ""
"Postaviti vrijednost priotiteta. Prioritet je proizvoljan broj između 0 i "
"100, gdje 100 znači najviši, a 0 označava najniži prioritet. Zadani "
"prioritet je 50."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-r</option>"
msgstr "<option>-r</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use realtime scheduling."
msgstr "Koristiti raspoređivanje u realnom vremenu."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:129
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-s</option>"
msgstr "<option>-s</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stop the kdesu daemon. This is the daemon that caches successful passwords "
"in the background. This feature may also be disabled with <option>-n</"
"option> when &kdesu; is initially run."
msgstr ""
"Zaustavljanje kdesu demona. Ovo je demon koji, u pozadini, hvata uspješne "
"lozinke. Ovo svojstvo može biti onemogućeno sa <option>-n</option> kada je "
"&kdesu; pokrenut."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-t</option>"
msgstr "<option>-t</option>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:136
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable terminal output. This disables password keeping. This is largely for "
"debugging purposes; if you want to run a console mode app, use the standard "
"<command>su</command> instead."
msgstr ""
"Omogućiti izlaz iz terminala, što onemogućuje čuvanje lozinke. Ovo se "
"uglavnom koristi za svrhe debugginga; ukoliko želite pokrenuti aplikaciju u "
"console modu, radije upotrijebite  <command>su</command> ."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>-u</option> <replaceable> user</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>-u</option> <replaceable> user</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:142
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While the most common use for &kdesu; is to run a command as the superuser, "
"you can supply any user name and the appropriate password."
msgstr ""
"Iako je najčešća  upotreba &kdesu;  pokrenuti naredbu kao superkorisnik, "
"možete dostaviti bilo koje korisničko ime uz odgovarajuću lozinku."

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "--noignorebutton"
msgstr "--noignorebutton"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not display an ignore button."
msgstr "Nemoj prikazati ignore dugme."

#. Tag: term
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "<option>--attach</option> <replaceable> winid</replaceable>"
msgstr "<option>--attach</option> <replaceable> winid</replaceable>"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:156
#, no-c-format
msgid "Makes the dialog transient for an X app specified by winid."
msgstr "Čini dijalog nestalan za X aplikaciju naznačenu sa winid."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "See Also"
msgstr "Također pogledati"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "su(1)"
msgstr "su(1)"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"More detailed user documentation is available from <ulink url=\"help:/kdesu"
"\">help:/kdesu</ulink> (either enter this <acronym>URL</acronym> into "
"&konqueror;, or run <userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/kdesu</parameter></userinput>)."
msgstr ""
"Još detaljnija korisnička dokumentacija je dostupna na <ulink url=\"help:/"
"kdesu\">help:/kdesu</ulink> (ili unesite <acronym>URL</acronym> into "
"&konqueror;, ili pokrenite <userinput><command>khelpcenter</command> "
"<parameter>help:/kdesu</parameter></userinput>)."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Primjeri"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:178
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Run <command>kfmclient</command> as user <systemitem class=\"username\">jim</"
"systemitem>, and show the &konqueror; icon in the password dialog:"
msgstr ""
"Pokrenite <command>kfmclient</command> kako korisnik <systemitem class="
"\"username\">jim</systemitem>, i prikažite &konqueror; ikonicu u dialogu za "
"lozinku:"

#. Tag: screen
#: man-kdesu.1.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</command> <option>-u "
"jim</option> <option>-i konqueror</option> <command>kfmclient</command></"
"userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>$(kde4-config --path libexec)<command>kdesu</command> <option>-u "
"jim</option> <option>-i konqueror</option> <command>kfmclient</command></"
"userinput>"

